{"_id":"6a391b35fe4d2e27089414bd","id":"Onemiss/Pangu-Weather_Forecasts","author":"Onemiss","sha":"857255f9050e36c35d2e60db00b239241f40fb7f","lastModified":"2026-06-22T17:36:27.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["arxiv:2603.21768","region:us","weather","precipitation-nowcasting","climate"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tPangu-Weather Forecasts for Spectral-Fusion Precipitation Nowcasting\n\t\n\n\n\n\nThis repository hosts the Pangu-Weather forecast data used in our paper\n\"Extending Precipitation Nowcasting Horizons via Spectral Fusion of Radar\nObservations and Foundation Model Priors\" (IJCNN 2026).\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tArray format\n\t\n\nEach forecast step is stored as two NumPy arrays, following Pangu-Weather's native\nvariable ordering:\n\n*_surface.npy — shape (4, H, W). The 4 surface variables.\n*_upper.npy — shape… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Onemiss/Pangu-Weather_Forecasts.","downloads":164,"likes":0,"cardData":{"tags":["weather","precipitation-nowcasting","climate"]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"meteonet_pangu/meteonet_pangu.z01"},{"rfilename":"meteonet_pangu/meteonet_pangu.z02"},{"rfilename":"meteonet_pangu/meteonet_pangu.z03"},{"rfilename":"meteonet_pangu/meteonet_pangu.z04"},{"rfilename":"meteonet_pangu/meteonet_pangu.z05"},{"rfilename":"meteonet_pangu/meteonet_pangu.zip"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z01"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z02"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z03"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z04"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z05"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z06"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z07"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z08"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z09"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z10"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z11"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z12"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z13"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.z14"},{"rfilename":"sevir_pangu/sevir_pangu.zip"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-22T11:23:33.000Z","usedStorage":106665698813}